Hi {Owner},

I build websites and portals for property management firms around {City}. {Business Name} manages a serious portfolio, but the site serves owners, residents and vendors from one page, with no sample owner report and a rentals page that doesn't match your listings.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: pages for each property type and market, a redacted owner report and portal tour, a resident hub by building, vendor onboarding with document upload and a rentals feed from your management system, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, feeds and changes. You approve every page before launch. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth twenty minutes with you and your operations lead this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
